[node name="BathMirror" type="Node3D"]
metadata/_doc = "Backlit bathroom mirror, frame 1.20 x 0.90 m, 35 mm off the wall, with a warm LED halo on the wall around it. Origin = bottom center of its back, on the wall plane; front +Z. Touch the round sensor near the bottom of the glass to switch the halo, the vanity light and the face light (on by default; the sensor ring stays dimly lit when off). The glass is a live mirror, one reflection per eye while it's in view (D-049)."

